// spec/assistant/receipts.md, "A receipt's title says what the journal proves"; spec/assistant/reply.md, "A failure refused before any output replaces the streamed text; any other failure is added after it"; spec/assistant/approvals.md, "Story: Decline or let a card expire"; spec/assistant/receipts.md, "A reply cut off after an effect says so, and a queued approval request reads as needing approval"
